{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_2000_place", "source_sha256": "95df2bbff941312dcf1c3a6fa7736b5eb42770b747e267f2454c667b3670e2d5", "ja": "ゲームショウ", "zh": "电玩展", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_2001_p", "source_sha256": "7b3841e57c78845eedfa725cb515e0b08722e53004905790e11330321693dfd7", "ja": "イベントのゲスト出演お疲れさま、千早。\nこれで、今日の仕事は全部終了だな。帰ろうか。", "zh": "担任活动的嘉宾辛苦了，千早。\n这样今天的工作就全部结束了，回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_2002_002chi", "source_sha256": "777687e0f20da7d3afe59c5e2ac9a8f5bbea1552de561d5031c4ef4f80552e9a", "ja": "あの、事務所に戻る前に、ひとつお願いが。\nじつは、気になっているゲームがあって……。", "zh": "那个，在回事务所之前，我有个请求。\n其实我有一款感兴趣的游戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_2003_002chi", "source_sha256": "a469892f68147a8cb05ea59d1203974447ee0099355499068e8244846205eb15", "ja": "あのリズムゲーム、私の歌が収録されているとか。\nご迷惑でなければ、一緒にプレイしてくれませんか？", "zh": "听说那款音乐节奏游戏有收录我的歌曲。\n要是不麻烦的话，可以和我一起去玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_2004_null", "source_sha256": "7491bd4a3bc78669c3329f4d1a54849c762571410be650cb9500047ffa871993", "ja": "―数十分後―", "zh": "─数十分钟后─", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_2005_002chi", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_2006_p", "source_sha256": "05af40709ea1fb8bb1b1b13146e6ca15fef6efa717a245b4951d84c7b998843b", "ja": "そんな暗い顔をしなくても……。\nもういい時間だし、この辺で切り上げないか？", "zh": "你不需要这么沮丧啊……\n时间也差不多了，就先告一个段落吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_2007_002chi", "source_sha256": "218ba25281886c941bafb880e7092cdb6bb7fc23351f7e58329d6044d943e3ea", "ja": "ですが、自分の歌なのにどうして……。\nすみません。納得ができません。", "zh": "但是，这明明是我自己的歌，为什么……\n不好意思，我无法接受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_002chi_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_002chi_2008_002chi", "source_sha256": "e8f0d453aa1db4b9ae7649e5be35133d5dad178307a90ff101b25ed333d3ce8a", "ja": "{$P$}、もう一度だけお願いします。\nBパートの2小節目さえ対応すれば、きっと……！", "zh": "{$P$}，麻烦再让我玩一次就好。\n只要能通过B段的第二小节，一定就能过关了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
